{"id": "aebf547d69e2d404cfc8e3a3b9d9a637d99929b7", "repo": "cashubtc/orchard", "sha": "aebf547d69e2d404cfc8e3a3b9d9a637d99929b7", "message": "chore: harden body parsing, require node 22.23.4\n\n- Reject compressed request bodies in the JSON and urlencoded parsers instead of decompressing them; Orchard's clients never send them, so these now get a 415\n- Raise the engines floor to Node 22.23.4 (October 2026 security release)", "authored_at": "2026-10-22T09:20:16Z", "committed_at": "2026-10-22T09:20:16Z", "author_login": "orangeshyguy21", "committer_login": "orangeshyguy21", "additions": 4, "deletions": 4, "changed_files": 3, "associated_merged_pr_numbers": [219], "url": "https://github.com/cashubtc/orchard/commit/aebf547d69e2d404cfc8e3a3b9d9a637d99929b7"}
